                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "TLDR - horrible but hilariously horrible. Ketchup is a vegetable. That's probably about all you need to know.\n\nIf you ever wanted to simulate what it's like to play the $100,000 pyramid with Bizarro this is probably as close as you'll get. Like the \"certain Chinese Encyclopedia\" in Borges come to life.\n\nI actually kind of want to give this a thumbs up because it's oddly addictive and will have you questioning your own sanity as you look for \"faster things\" without knowing what they're faster than and wonder whether or not the pepper will qualify as a vegetable in this particular puzzle since it only sometimes does.\n\nIf you want a laugh grab it in a bundle or for pocket change, but don't pay anywhere close to the asking price.",
